Z||000014||theogre||02-27-2000||12:43 PM||||I believe you are refering to the Mecham Pontiac scope set that Focoa and others reference allot. Mecham Pontiac is/was a pontiac dealer that offered the custom parts. These are not and never were an OE pontiac item.<P>These itmes, if done to original specs, replace the pannel between the wheel and door from the trim line down. The right side one can be used for a number of things in addition to just ramming air into the engine compartment.||||reg||1
